# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Code-execution worker — production secrets
#
# Copy to `.env.production` and fill in. Gitignored; uploaded by `pnpm deploy`:
#
#     wrangler deploy --secrets-file .env.production
#
# Additive: omitted keys are left alone. An EMPTY value, however, overwrites the
# live secret with an empty string — delete the line instead of blanking it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Shared HMAC secret, byte-identical to apps/main. The app signs `run_code` /
# `check_execution` tokens with it and this worker verifies them.
WORKER_SECRET=""
